    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 114:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "*Quand Israël sortit d'Égypte, [et] la maison de Jacob d'avec un peuple qui parle une langue étrangère,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.114.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.114.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 114:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Juda fut son sanctuaire, Israël la sphère de sa domination.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.114.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.114.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 114:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "La mer le vit, et s'enfuit ; le Jourdain retourna en arrière ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.114.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.114.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 114:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Les montagnes sautèrent comme des béliers, les collines comme des agneaux.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.114.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.114.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 114:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qu'avais-tu, mer, pour t'enfuir ; toi, Jourdain, pour retourner en arrière ?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.114.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.114.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 114:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vous, montagnes, pour sauter comme des béliers ; vous, collines, comme des agneaux ?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.114.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.114.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 114:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Devant la face du Seigneur, tremble, ô terre ! devant la face du",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.114.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.114.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "✝Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.114.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.114.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "de Jacob,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.114.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.114.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 114:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qui a changé le rocher en un étang d'eau, la pierre dure en une source d'eaux.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.114.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.114.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
